  "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
  "instance_name": "mapping_1",
  "label": "bicycle mapped as 'the first one'",
  "description": "The top text 'what's the difference between the 2?' and the bottom text 'the first one can't sing when you put chains on it' create an analogical mapping where the bicycle is identified as 'the first one'. This mapping equates the bicycle with the first Black man in the photograph, using the visual pun that 'putting chains on it' (referring to the bicycle) is analogous to the historical oppression of enslaved Black people. The mapping is established through the textual framing and the juxtaposition of the bicycle with the photograph of the two men.",
